Credits and notes

- AI disclosure: The code, the texture and the documentation of this mod were
  written with substantial help from an AI assistant (Claude by Anthropic),
  directed, reviewed and play-tested by the author. All commits in the
  repository are authored by "Claude".

- Third-party assets used at runtime: The mod displays models, textures and
  sounds that belong to VoxeLibre (e.g. mcl_armor_character.b3d, mcl_skins
  textures, villager textures, mcl_shield.obj, sounds). They are NOT included
  in this repository; they are loaded from the installed VoxeLibre game and
  remain under VoxeLibre's licenses (see the VoxeLibre repository).

- Inspiration: The gameplay is inspired by the Minecraft mod "Villager
  Recruits". No code, textures or other assets from it are included.
